## 🎯 Globs Patterns đã áp dụng

### Standard File Types (Từ .windsurf)
```
**/*.java          # Java source files
**/*.py            # Python source files
**/*.ts            # TypeScript source files
**/*.tsx           # TypeScript React files
**/*.js            # JavaScript source files
**/*.jsx           # JavaScript React files
**/*.json          # JSON configuration files
**/*.yaml          # YAML configuration files
**/*.yml           # YAML configuration files (alternative)
**/*.xml           # XML configuration files
**/*.md            # Markdown documentation files
**/*.txt           # Text files
**/*.html          # HTML files
```

### Directory Patterns
```
**/src/**/*.*      # All files in src directories
**/config/**/*.* # All files in config directories
**/scripts/**/*.*  # All files in scripts directories
```

### Service-Specific Patterns
```
**/user-management-service/**/*.*
**/file-management-service/**/*.*
**/automation-service/**/*.*
**/api-gateway/**/*.*
```

### Configuration Files
```
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/pom.xml
**/requirements.txt
**/package.json
**/build.gradle
**/application.properties
**/application.yml
```

### Script Files
```
**/*.ps1
**/*.bat
**/*.sh
```

